          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, all these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.33.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.33.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "worketh God oftentimes with man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To bring back his soul from the pit, to be enlightened with the light of the living.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mark well, O Job, hearken unto me: hold thy peace, and I will speak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou hast any thing to say, answer me: speak, for I desire to justify thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If not, hearken unto me: hold thy peace, and I shall teach thee wisdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.33.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
